\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O King of mercy, 
\par from Thy throne on high
\par Look down in love, 
\par and hear our humble cry.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Thou tender Shepherd of 
\par the blood-bought sheep,
\par Thy feeble wandering flock
\par in safety keep.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. O gentle Saviour, 
\par by Thy death we live;
\par To contrite sinners life
\par eternal give.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Thou art the Bread of heaven,
\par on Thee we feed;
\par Be near to help our souls
\par in time of need.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Thou art the mourner's Stay,
\par the sinner's Friend,
\par Sweet Fount of joy and blessings
\par without end.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. O come and cheer us with
\par Thy heavenly grace;
\par Reveal the brightness of Thy 
\par glorious face.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7. In cooling cloud by day,
\par in fire by night,
\par Be near our steps, and
\par make our comfort, Strength and Guide.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 8\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 8. Go where we go, abide
\par where we abide,
\par In life, in death, our Comfort,
\par Strength and Guide.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 9\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 9. O lead us daily with Thine
\par eye of love,
\par And bring us safely to 
\par our home above.
\par Amen. \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

